---
/**
 * README 里的上手三步：装插件、选模型、把目标交给 /poteto-mode。
 * 宽屏横排，窄屏改成一列。
 * 动效沿用常驻 Agent 那篇。没有 JS、打印、prefers-reduced-motion 时直接以终态展示。
 */
import '../../blog/20261011 - alwaysOnAgents/figures.css'

import RevealBoot from '../../blog/20261011 - alwaysOnAgents/RevealBoot.astro'

const steps = [
  { name: '装上插件', cmd: '/add-plugin pstack', accent: false },
  { name: '选模型和预算', cmd: '/setup-pstack', accent: false },
  { name: '交目标，并说怎么算做完', cmd: '/poteto-mode', accent: true }
]
---

<figure class='aoa-fig ps-setup not-prose' data-ps-setup>
  <figcaption class='aoa-cap'>
    <strong>图 2 · README 里的上手三步。</strong>
    前两步是准备。第三步才开始做事。Claude Code 的安装命令写在图下面，不塞进这三张卡片。
  </figcaption>

  <div class='ps-setup-row' role='list'>
    {
      steps.map((step, i) => (
        <>
          <div
            class:list={['aoa-card', 'ps-setup-card', 'aoa-rv', { 'aoa-card-accent': step.accent }]}
            style={`--i: ${i}`}
            role='listitem'
          >
            <p class='aoa-kicker'>0{i + 1}</p>
            <p class='aoa-title'>{step.name}</p>
            <p class='ps-cmd'>{step.cmd}</p>
          </div>
          {i < steps.length - 1 && (
            <span class='ps-chev aoa-rv' style={`--i: ${i}`} aria-hidden='true'>
              <span class='ps-chev-glyph'>→</span>
            </span>
          )}
        </>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <p class='aoa-note'>
    示意图。三条命令都写在 pstack 的 README 里。第三张用青色，是因为工作从这里开始。
  </p>
  <p class='aoa-sr'>
    三步：先在 Cursor 里运行 /add-plugin pstack，再运行 /setup-pstack 选择模型和推理预算，然后用
    /poteto-mode 交出目标以及怎么算做完。
  </p>
  <RevealBoot />
</figure>

<script>
  import { armReveal } from '../../blog/20261011 - alwaysOnAgents/reveal'

  armReveal('[data-ps-setup]', undefined, 0.28)
</script>

<style>
  .ps-setup {
    container-type: inline-size;
  }

  .ps-setup-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .ps-setup-card {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ps-setup-card .aoa-title,
  .ps-setup-card .aoa-kicker,
  .ps-cmd {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    writing-mode: horizontal-tb;
  }

  .ps-cmd {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.88);
  }

  .ps-chev {
    display: flex;
    align-self: center;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0;
    color: hsl(var(--primary));
  }

  .ps-chev-glyph {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  :global(.dark) .ps-setup-card.aoa-card-accent {
    border-color: hsl(var(--primary) / 0.85);
    background: hsl(var(--primary) / 0.14);
  }

  :global(.dark) .ps-setup-card:not(.aoa-card-accent) {
    background: hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.04);
  }

  @container (max-width: 560px) {
    .ps-setup-row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      justify-items: center;
    }

    .ps-setup-card {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ps-chev-glyph {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ps-chev-glyph {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
